            "cites": [3]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Kendrick supports amending the state constitution for a progressive income tax, stating it would let lawmakers adjust rates without increasing the burden on lowest-income residents. His public safety plan includes making multiple retail thefts a felony and filling what he states are 2,000 vacant Chicago police officer positions. He supports reducing regulatory burdens to encourage development and expand the housing supply.",
